# Qwen-Image-Edit-2511 Lightning LORA

This directory will contain the 8-step distilled LORA weights.

## Download Instructions

```bash
huggingface-cli download lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning \
    --local-dir models/loras/qwen-image-edit-2511 \
    --local-dir-use-symlinks False
```

Expected file: `Qwen-Image-Edit-2511-Lightning-8steps-V1.0-fp32.safetensors`

See the main [models/README.md](../../README.md) for complete setup instructions.
